      "number": 75,
      "status": "fixed",
      "details": "Ground triangle follows the interpolated figure transform, with a 46.4-degree apex independent of camera orientation.",
      "url": "https://github.com/TheWWWorm/CursedLands/issues/75"
    },
    {
      "number": 76,
      "status": "fixed",
      "details": "Original indexed mouth atlases animate only the current speaking actor. Database mouth coordinates and original open/closed strips are composed into two immutable full-size skin textures before filtering, preventing adjacent strip bleed in the world and preview shaders. Portrait heads map the same authored mouth into the separate face atlas. Shipped shaders retain independent wound overlays; StandardMaterial3D uses the same compositor. The body special may return to listening while lips continue until the phrase ends; #nolips, skip, final-line duration/voice completion, close, death and redress preserve the correct state. Head materials are owned before highlight copies exist.",
      "url": "https://github.com/TheWWWorm/CursedLands/issues/76"
    },
    {
      "number": 77,
      "status": "fixed",
      "details": "Logical UV canvas follows original item model family; stable under higher resolution/repacked texture data in inventory and wiki renderers.",
      "url": "https://github.com/TheWWWorm/CursedLands/issues/77"
    }
